  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHq/553",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d6f4677775a3a502a6b5c6d95fdd0a180c6f30b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d6f4677775a3a502a6b5c6d95fdd0a180c6f30b\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><br>체육시간에 많이 하는<br><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">색판뒤집기 활동!</span><br>빨간 색이 많이 보이면 빨간 팀 승리!<br><br><br>물질변화 예시에 가져다 써봅니다 <br>설명보다 나은&#160;<span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">6초짜리 영상</span>입니다.&#160;<br></b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvhfmnyfuh1kvr8xlcfwcbxbp@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvhfmnyfuh1kvr8xlcfwcbxbp/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33266707023&amp;signature=%2BKnufFlaEWLzwGAVSACZlD8cO6Q%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvhfmnyfuh1kvr8xlcfwcbxbp?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2aGZtbnlmdWgxa3ZyOHhsY2Z3Y2J4YnAiLCJ0aWQiOiJhMjA4NmY4ZC0wMGRmLTQxNTEtYTYyNS1mMGI3Nzg5ZDUxMWUiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODM2Mzd9.fLK2slFwi5j3OR-gBiMkkFtw8saoPU7uRofkyXdQuKbh2aBVEPzywCF9xWUc-8i15ZV9Lt_OlrcCcfEWQHHyeg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b>2명 물리변화팀</b><br><b>2명 화학변화팀<br><br>카드 한 면에는 <span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">물리변화예시가</span><br>뒷 면에는 <span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">화학변화예시가</span> 있습니다.<br><br><br>각자 팀에 해당하는 예시를<br>많이 <span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">보이게</span> 뒤집으면 이깁니다!<br>&#160;<br><br></b><br><b>15장 중 3장은 앞뒤가 같은 변화입니다.<br><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">일부 카드는 앞뒤가 같은 변화라고</span><br>안내하시면 <u><span style=\"color: #0593D3;\">요행으로 다른 팀이 뒤집는걸<br>따라 뒤집기만 하는 것을<br>방지</span></u>할 수 있습니다. </b><br>&#160;<br><br><br><b>너무 긴 시간은 <br>음...물리적 다툼과<br>각종 못볼 꼴을 볼 수</b><b> 있어서</b><br>&#160;<br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">딱 1분.</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">함께 해보는 시간<br>연습 1분</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">본게임 1분</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b>재미는 보장합니다. ㅋㅋㅋㅋ</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d0d660f9b6f6aacf68180a55e430a8fd21b9db2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d0d660f9b6f6aacf68180a55e430a8fd21b9db2\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b>카드를<span style=\"color: #006DD7;\"> 무작위로</span> 뿌리고</b><br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">노터치!</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1분 시작!</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/964bc22e0648dccf813261f495bd27e0e496a37a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/964bc22e0648dccf813261f495bd27e0e496a37a\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b>시간 종료 후<br>대충 정리하게 하고</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">물리변화만</span> 번호로 부르면</span>&#160;</b><br>&#160;<br><b>물리팀과 화학팀 중</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">이기는 팀을 쉽게</span> 구별할 수 있습니다.</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d5fb16e6e8ae5207fa83875aa703b712928a187b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d5fb16e6e8ae5207fa83875aa703b712928a187b\" data-origin-width=\"1048\" data-origin-height=\"739\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">양면 인쇄를</span> 하시면 되구요.</b><br>&#160;<br><b>여러번 쓰기 위해선&#160;</b><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">코팅!</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a56ca01cb2415cc5509473c67491093592931f6c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a56ca01cb2415cc5509473c67491093592931f6c\" data-origin-width=\"515\" data-origin-height=\"740\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4136b924ddb5932ed3bdb240f96ce1d346c664b4?download\" data-file-name=\"뒤집기_물질변화예시.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"48944\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D553%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20240307170917&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F4136b924ddb5932ed3bdb240f96ce1d346c664b4')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">뒤집기_물질변화예시</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">47.80KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>음....</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">작두질은 생각보다</span></b><br><b>정신건강에 도움이 됩니다.&#160;</b><br>&#160;<br><b>하하하하</b><br>&#160;<br><b>ㅠㅡㅠ</b></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
